3. Dedicated brcmsmac-derived tuning data -- bcm4313_lcntab.h
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Generated byte-for-byte from brcmsmac phy/phytbl_lcn.c (BCM4313 switch-control
and RX-gain tables).

  SPDX-License-Identifier: ISC

  Permission to use, copy, modify, and/or distribute this software for any
